          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x+3}{4}\\div\\frac{x+5}{4}&=\\frac{x+3}{4}\\times\\frac{4}{x+5}\\\\&=\\frac{x+3}{x+5}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
